- Use only real library calls for BOTH sides (no hand-rolled reference implementation).
- On violation, `throw new RuntimeException("metamorphic violation: <which relation> input=<...> lhs=<...> rhs=<...>")` with the concrete values, so a reviewer can replay the disagreement. Jazzer reports that as a finding, the same as a crash.

