        // Contract asserted here:
        // - default scale maps 0.0 to black and 1.0 to white;
        // - values outside the bounds are clamped, so -0.5 maps like 0.0 and 1.5 maps like 1.0.
        // A patch that merely suppresses the throw or makes the failing branch unreachable but returns
        // the wrong color would violate these observable results.
        try {
