        // "no" => false) and otherwise return false. The implementation shown and the
        // regression test both establish case-insensitive handling, so for any ASCII
        // input s, changing letter case only must not change the boolean result.
        // A patch that merely avoids the crash by deleting logic or making a branch
        // unreachable can violate this relation without throwing.

        // 1) ANCHOR: exact trigger from the failing test / ground truth.
        callAndMaybePropagate("off");

        // 2) EXPLORE: same public API, varied inputs hitting the patched logic.
